{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935800/extras/a30ff70e93036edb7b3950d6f7f77774.avif?t=1761868780\" alt=\"The twisted imagination of erotic mastermind Sei Shoujo brings you a sensual midsummer night&#039;s dream... or perhaps a tantalizing nightmare. The background graphic depicts two nude women, main characters in the game, from the chest up lying in a bed of red rose petals.\" width=780 height=497 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twisted imagination of erotic mastermind Sei Shoujo brings you a sensual midsummer night's dream... or perhaps a tantalizing nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow college student, Takamiya Ryouhei, to the luxurious Black Rose Manor where he's due to spend a week tutoring Maria, the stunning daughter of the estate's equally gorgeous mistress, Marie, and attended to by the estate's alluring maid, Aria. But how much tutoring can he hope to accomplish surrounded by the temptation of three beautiful yet terribly lonely women?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ryouhei descends into abject debauchery as their new plaything, is the future that awaits him a rosy one? Or is it more of a nightmare...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935800/extras/c71863bf60353f65c7b7e52c56ec7fb9.avif?t=1761868780\" alt=\"Written and Illustrated by Sei Shoujo. The illustration features several pieces of art from the game fading into unfinishsed lineart with pens over top to imply the drawing process.\" width=780 height=497 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sei Shoujo, the creator of titles as influential as they are infamous such as Bible Black and STARLESS, is back once again as both artist and writer for SLEEPLESS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935800/extras/c13c8cb1d09264872ab6b629bbb79d09.avif?t=1761868780\" alt=\"Variety and Spice. The graphic depicts portions of three illustrations featuring the game&#039;s main female cast. The central figure is nude.\" width=780 height=497 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With three equally alluring heroines participating in a wide variety of detailed, and lovingly illustrated and voice acted erotic scenarios, perhaps SLEEPLESS will prove to be a dream you'll never want to wake up from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935800?t=1761868780","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935800?t=1761868780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935800/a8c7824a4fd6ce39e4d9589c2a43ff1405f43bb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761868780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935800/a8c7824a4fd6ce39e4d9589c2a43ff1405f43bb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761868780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This title is designed for adult (18+) audiences only. The content of this game may not be suitable for all people. \r\n\r\nThis game contains fictional representations of the following: nudity, sexual interactions including consensual sex, nonconsensual sex, bondage, mammary intercourse, oral sex, breast milk, incest, feces, and urine.\r\n\r\nAll players of this s